{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "一个卡住全部",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 109.54,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "外部调用的第三种后果，是拒绝服务。",
   "spoken": "外部掉用的第三种后果，是拒绝服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.475
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "攻击者不偷钱，而是让合约的某个功能，长期用不了。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不偷钱，而是让合约的某个功能，长期用不了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.86,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 4.86,
   "speechEnd": 9.17
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "再猜一道题。拍卖合约收到新出价时，把钱直接退给上一位出价者。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。拍卖合约收到新出价时，把钱直接退给上一位出价者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.64,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 9.64,
   "speechEnd": 15.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "上一位出价者是一个合约，它的 receive 函数总是回滚。",
   "spoken": "上一位出价者是一个合约，它的 receive 函数总是回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 15.78,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 15.87,
   "speechEnd": 20.51
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "新出价能成功吗？",
   "spoken": "新出价能成功吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 20.88,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 20.88,
   "speechEnd": 22.702
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "不能。退款失败，让整笔新出价回滚。",
   "spoken": "不能。退款失败，让整笔新出价回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 23.38,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 23.475,
   "speechEnd": 26.702
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "它会一直占着最高出价者的位置。",
   "spoken": "它会一直占着最高出价者的位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 27.12,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 27.12,
   "speechEnd": 29.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "换成快递：100 个包裹，要按顺序送完。",
   "spoken": "换成快递：100 个包裹，要按顺序送完。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 30.06,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 30.06,
   "speechEnd": 33.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第 1 个被拒收，后面 99 个都送不出去。",
   "spoken": "第 1 个被拒收，后面 99 个都送不出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 33.48,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 33.48,
   "speechEnd": 36.565
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "修复是拉取式支付。合约只记账，收款人自己来取。",
   "spoken": "修复是拉取式支付。合约只记账，收款人自己来取。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 36.98,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 37.071,
   "speechEnd": 41.677
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "一个人拒收，只影响他自己。",
   "spoken": "一个人拒收，只影响他自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 42.08,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 42.174,
   "speechEnd": 44.135
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "类似的毛病，还有几种。",
   "spoken": "类似的毛病，还有几种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 44.54,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 44.632,
   "speechEnd": 46.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "遍历所有用户发奖励。用户一多，就超过区块 gas 上限。",
   "spoken": "遍历所有用户发奖励。用户一多，就超过区块 gas 上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 46.68,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 46.779,
   "speechEnd": 51.422
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "改成分页，或者用累计奖励因子。",
   "spoken": "改成分页，或者用累计奖励因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 51.86,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 51.953,
   "speechEnd": 54.853
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "批量分发 USDT，其中一个地址被冻结，整批失败。",
   "spoken": "批量分发 USDT，其中一个地址被冻结，整批失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 55.28,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 55.377,
   "speechEnd": 59.555
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "改成逐个捕获失败，记账，等对方来领。",
   "spoken": "改成逐个捕获失败，记账，等对方来领。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 59.98,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 59.98,
   "speechEnd": 63.639
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "要求余额严格等于记录值。被人强制转入 1 wei，就再也对不上。",
   "spoken": "要求余额严格等于记录值。被人强制转入 1 wei，就再也对不上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 64.04,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 64.133,
   "speechEnd": 69.954
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "改用大于等于。",
   "spoken": "改用大于等于。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 70.42,
   "dur": 1.44,
   "speechStart": 70.42,
   "speechEnd": 71.656
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "TRON 上，每次执行有 80 毫秒的 CPU 时间上限。",
   "spoken": "TRON 上，每次执行有 80 毫秒的 CPU 时间上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 72.08,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 72.08,
   "speechEnd": 76.123
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "以太坊上够用的循环，在 TRON 上可能超时。",
   "spoken": "以太坊上够用的循环，在 TRON 上可能超时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 76.54,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 76.634,
   "speechEnd": 79.854
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "真实案例。2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Akutars NFT。",
   "spoken": "真实案例。2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Akutars NFT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 80.28,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 80.379,
   "speechEnd": 85.064
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "它的推送退款，可以被一个拒收合约卡死。",
   "spoken": "它的推送退款，可以被一个拒收合约卡死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 85.54,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 85.54,
   "speechEnd": 88.729
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "项目方提款的条件，又比较了错误的变量，永远不成立。",
   "spoken": "项目方提款的条件，又比较了错误的变量，永远不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-22.wav",
   "start": 89.2,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 89.2,
   "speechEnd": 93.774
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "超过 11539 个 ETH，被永久锁定。",
   "spoken": "超过 11539 个 ETH，被永久锁定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-23.wav",
   "start": 94.22,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 94.22,
   "speechEnd": 98.579
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-24",
   "text": "按 BlockSec 的分析，直接锁死资金的，是第二个缺陷。",
   "spoken": "按 BlockSec 的分析，直接锁死资金的，是第二个缺陷。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-24.wav",
   "start": 99.0,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 99.0,
   "speechEnd": 103.73
  },
  {
